whois
Usage: whois DOMAIN_or_IP

Looks up who registered a domain or owns an ip range -- registrar, dates,
contacts, netblock. The one basic lookup busybox does not ship. A quiet first
question in recon: who is this, on paper?

	whois example.com    a domain's registration record
	whois 1.2.3.4        the owner/netblock of an address

See also: subfinder, dnsx
